        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Danilo Erricolo\n- Organizations: University of Illinois Chicago, Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers (IEEE)\n- Publications: IEEE Transactions on Antennas and Propagation\n- Roles: Fellow, Editor-in-Chief\n- Topics: Electromagnetic scattering, computational algorithms\n\nFacts:\n- IEEE Transactions on Antennas and Propagation was established in 1952.\n- IEEE Transactions on Antennas and Propagation is published monthly with occasional special issues.\n- In 2016, the Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers named Danilo Erricolo an IEEE Fellow for contributions to electromagnetic scattering and associated computational algorithms.\n- Danilo Erricolo is an Italian-American engineer from the University of Illinois Chicago.\n- Danilo Erricolo is the current Editor-in-Chief of IEEE Transactions on Antennas and Propagation.",
